{"ts":"2026-08-16T10:27:59.110Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"736bc2ce37b57aa429143ced","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-suhxny","lineage:pm-suhxny","lineage:pm-usfg","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-suhxny","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-suhxny","lineage:pm-suhxny","lineage:pm-usfg","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.233","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-f6zjpq"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Agent skills routed to a workflow loop but named no capability family and no read-cost, so four of twelve command families and the entire output-budget surface were unreachable through progressive disclosure"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The four canonical skill bundles taught the claim-implement-close loop and routed to two references each. They named no capability map, so graph, assurance, merge, and the read-output budget family had no entry point at any tier; and they annotated no retrieval cost, so an agent could not tell that a routed document was 275 tokens or 45,000."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:agent-ux","area:docs","context-management","progressive-disclosure","skills"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-16T10:27:59.110Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-16T10:27:59.110Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Every SKILL.md declares an explicit load order with measured per-tier costs; Every command family reachable from the CLI has an entry command and a guide topic named in at least one skill; pm guide covers the previously unrouted families so runtime routing does not depend on prose; Each skill's references are individually loadable, cost-annotated, and route into large documents by section rather than whole; A reference file that no SKILL.md links to fails the docs/skills gate; The author-detection and never-pass-author rule appears in every bundle"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-mpbb"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"An agent can reach any pm capability through a bounded, cost-known expansion path."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Four capability families had no route, and no route declared its cost."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-suhxny","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-16T10:27:59.110Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"97d2dde97a7863c1025578f6c3c8635ee710e46df0282bbd844e2a0a1b2edbec","item_hash_version":2,"message":"Filed from a coverage comparison of skill routing against the generated command surface"}
